    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d80">

                <pb facs="0213" n="117" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg117"/>

                <head>No. 78.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williamson to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation in Central America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1873-11-25"><hi rendition="#italic">Nov</hi>.
                            25, 1873</date>. (Received December 30.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 60.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose you
                    correspondence with the minister of foreign affairs of Nicaragua, in regard to a
                    printed circular sent me to be forwarded to the Government, and also translated
                    copy of said circular. Allow me to call your attention to my letter, of which a
                    copy is inclosed.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>GEO. WILLIAMSON.</signed></closer>




